CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model data:observe_data --nondet-volatile-write-model cmd:observe_cmd --mmio-weak
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
data committed before GO: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Weak device memory (--mmio-weak) with a full barrier between the two register
writes: the barrier flushes the posted write to the data register before the
command is observed, so the ordering assertion holds. Compare mmio-weak-01,
where the same model without the barrier fails.
